== Description ==

'''Magnet''' is a crafted component in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 4 downstream recipes at the [[Electronics Workbench]], including [[Transformer]], [[Sound Sensor]], [[Simple Motor]], [[Simple Generator]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

